---
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden pb-16 pt-20 sm:pt-28">
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 -top-32 h-[420px] opacity-60"
    style="background: radial-gradient(circle at 25% 30%, rgba(139,124,246,0.16), transparent 55%), radial-gradient(circle at 75% 45%, rgba(91,141,239,0.14), transparent 50%);"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="container-page relative">
    <p
      class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-ink-dim opacity-0 animate-fade-up"
      style="animation-delay: 60ms"
    >
      <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-violet shadow-[0_0_10px_theme(colors.violet)]"></span>
      ADJ — independent developer
    </p>

    <h1
      class="max-w-[14ch] font-display text-[2.4rem] font-bold leading-[1.02] tracking-tight opacity-0 animate-fade-up sm:text-[3.4rem] lg:text-[4.4rem]"
      style="animation-delay: 140ms"
    >
      I make boring tools feel considered.
    </h1>

    <p
      class="mt-7 max-w-[58ch] text-lg text-ink-dim opacity-0 animate-fade-up"
      style="animation-delay: 240ms"
    >
      Compression, focus timers, recommendation engines — software people open for ten seconds and
      never think about twice. I spend the time other people skip.
      <span class="font-medium text-ink">Every one of these ships from GitHub's browser editor — no local clone, ever.</span>
    </p>

    <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3 opacity-0 animate-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 320ms">
      <a
        href="#projects"
        class="grad-fill rounded-full px-6 py-3 font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-canvas transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5"
      >
        See the projects
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/ADJ189"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="rounded-full border border-line px-6 py-3 font-mono text-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-violet"
      >
        GitHub profile ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="border-y border-line bg-surface">
  <div class="container-page grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3">
    <div class="border-line py-6 sm:border-r">
      <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ink-faint">Environment</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-dim">
        Built entirely through <span class="font-medium text-ink">GitHub's web editor</span> — no local clone.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="border-line py-6 sm:border-r sm:pl-8">
      <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ink-faint">Standard</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-dim">
        <span class="font-medium text-ink">Type-checks and builds run clean</span> before anything ships.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="py-6 sm:pl-8">
      <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ink-faint">Stack</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-dim">
        Vanilla TypeScript first, deployed on <span class="font-medium text-ink">Cloudflare Pages</span>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
